theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 12
text = "Your objective is to fetch firewood and feed it to the campfire to survive the day.

Your scarf is trailing you and growing longer each day, and coming into contact with it will slow you down severely.

Your blink ability allows you to travel through the scarf, or escape it when stuck.

There are various pickups that can appear. Try them out!"
